<title>JAPAN: RESEARCH ALERT - Daikyo cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Daikyo cut.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yamaichi Research Institute of Securities and Economics Inc said it downgraded Daikyo Inc to a &quot;3&quot; rating from its previous &quot;2&quot;.</p>
<p>In its three-grade rating system, the research institute assigns a &quot;3&quot; rating to issues whose values it expects will underperform the Tokyo Stock Exchange first-section TOPIX index by more than 10 percentage points over the following six months.</p>
</text>
